{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2010-deet-science2-10","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2010,"subject":"chemistry","number":10,"points":2,"unitId":"equilibrium","unitLabel":"화학 평형","topic":"평형반응·평형상수","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["equilibrium","acid"],"stem":"다음은 수용액에서 히스티딘(HL)의 평형 반응식과 25℃에서의 \nK값이다.\n2＋(aq) ⇄ H2L\n＋(aq) + H\n＋(aq)\nH3L\nK1=1.8\n＋(aq) ⇄ HL(aq) + H\n＋(aq)\nH2L\nK2=6.0\n－(aq) + H\n＋(aq)\nHL(aq) ⇄ L\nK3=9.0\n25℃에서의 히스티딘 수용액에 관련된 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>\n에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 0.10M H2LC 수용액 50L에 0.10M NOH 수용액 \n25L를 섞은 용액의 H는 6.0이다. \nㄴ. 0.10M HL 수용액 25L에 0.10M HC 수용액 25L를\n섞은 용액은 산성이다.\nㄷ. H2L＋(aq)+L－(aq)⇄2HL(aq) 반응의 평형 상수(K)에 \n대한 K=−3.0이다. ","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04","fig-05"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t025"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t026"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t027"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t028"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t029"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":323,"height":27,"region":0,"bbox":[163.5,4.903,129.2,10.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t001"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-deet-science2-10/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":47,"height":32,"region":0,"bbox":[16.7,24.503,18.8,12.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-deet-science2-10/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":612,"height":139,"region":0,"bbox":[34.7,52.503,244.8,55.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-d